Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.47,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H705079&\pos(720,311.34)\3c&HE5E8E6&\bord4}Police
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.94,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's chase our dreams...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:53.03,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... holding hearts burning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:57.41,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... like the summer sunshine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:01:01.37,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we have courage...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.46,0:01:04.50,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... at 100 miles an hour...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:12.64,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I'm sure the door will open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:19.77,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since sadness is the road{\i0}\N{\i1}that leads to smiles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:28.48,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... dull, dingy shoes will{\i0}\N{\i1}start to shine, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:35.20,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most wonderful dream{\i0}\N{\i1}in the world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:41.91,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pounding beat speeds up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:49.05,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The eyes are prisms that{\i0}\N{\i1}catch the wind...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:56.85,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... and in the voices of{\i0}\N{\i1}countless friends...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:02:03.69,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I feel happiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.75,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,644.67)}AND SO THEY MET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:40.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,As of this moment, fifteen minutes\Nlate already, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:04.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let it slide! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,I guess not, after all.\NIn that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Whew...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:15.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,She couldn't have chased\Nme this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,N... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:28.41,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\bord4\c&H000000&\3c&HCDC4C3&\move(1543.21,434.58,429.16,594.84,17,1393)\frz13.6}Police
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:34.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,It ain't fair if all that counts is speed!\NI'm gonna get caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,A temple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:37.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,My lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:45.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:50.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed. But it looks like\Nshe's reached her limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:54.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Heave! Heave! Heave-HO!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:00.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,NATSUMI POWER BOOST ON!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:04.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,DASH! Left-right! Left-right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:17.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,In hopes that I can do well\Nat my new workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:31.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oshou! Oshou! You sure are\Nlively, considering the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fs52}Note:{\b0} "Oshou:" in Buddhism, the priest in charge of a temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:32.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:34.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry, so I'll\Ncatch you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,Whew! I thought I was a goner.\NWhat's the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nine... Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:20.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,There! Hey, kitty, that was pretty\Ndangerous, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Even though you're lucky\Nit was me passing by...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:27.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,...you were on the verge of becoming\Ntoday's first accident fatality! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:31.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! You're hungry,\Nhuh? OK, OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:36.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gone... It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:44.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,My lunch... My lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,And now, the question;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,How many moving violations\Ndid you commit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:07:04.70,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(238.67,814)}Score
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Use of an area prohibited to motor traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Changing lanes in a no-passing zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:06:59.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Disobeying traffic signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:02.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Disregarding instructions of an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:05.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,And... exceeding the speed limit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.36,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(720,746)\c&H110CD3&\shad2\4c&H00008E&}Suspension of License{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:12.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,The posted legal speed is 30 kph, so\Nthat puts you 25 kph over...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,...but in deference to kitty,\NI'll let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,So if you would kindly\Nsign here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,...Ms. Natsumi Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? How do you\Nknow my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Bokuto Precinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:35.95,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H332C44&\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs42\pos(720,678)}Bokuto Police Station
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:37.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,As of today, you are a policewoman\Nof Bokuto Precinct. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:42.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:46.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,And on your first day of duty, you're\Nan hour and ten minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:46.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Incorrect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:47.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,An hour and twelve\Nminutes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's some nerve\Nyou've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:53.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,People say that to me\Nall the time, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:57.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,In any case, if you have an\Nexcuse, I'll hear it. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:07:59.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:04.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,The truth is, today, I actually got the\Nfried egg for lunch done really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:07.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,And when I went to give it to the old lady\Nnext door, she was so psyched!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:10.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,She went on about how I just had\Nto become her grandson's bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,But her grandson is\Nstill only seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,...so she gave me lots of pickled\Nvegetables by way of thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and I was re-soaking them when\NI looked at my watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:17.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and suddenly it was\Neight o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:19.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,I raced like mad to get myself together,\Nand when I got on my RZ...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:22.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,...wouldn't you know it, the\Nengine wouldn't turn over!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,And it was just fine\Nyesterday, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:29.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,But that's A-OK! I have a Moto-Compo,\Ny'know! And it's in top condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,If I really pushed it, I'd be on time!\NAm I lucky or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't going to\Nget off that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:35.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,No sooner did I hit Mito Boulevard,\Nthen, of all things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Pun on "Mito Koomon," a famous TV samurai.\NYou ran into Lord Koomon's entourage, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:44.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh? Oh, wow. Making a joke that\Nfar off must be a kind of genius, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:48.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:53.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I, Natsumi Tsujimoto, was\Nlate, but I will give my all for my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:58.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,In the name of love, courage, and justice,\NI will protect the people! That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:01.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,All right! Welcome aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:06.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,My fellow officers, I, Natsumi Tsujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:09.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,...hope that we will work\Nwell together. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:12.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,As she says. I want you all to help\Nher out wherever necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa, come\Nhere for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:22.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is Miyuki Kobayakawa. She too was\Njust assigned here this past spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:25.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,Starting today, she will\Nbe your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:27.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki Kobayakawa.\NHow do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Partner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:39.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,You've got real nerve.\NI like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:41.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:43.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm getting to like it here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:46.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,It looks like this is a happening\Nplace, and it feels right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,I like the way you talk. I'm Ken\NNakajima, motorcycle patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:53.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,People call me the "White Hawk\Nof Bokuto." How do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:01.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, Yoriko, I have some things\Nto do, so take over for me, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:05.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll fix those binoculars\Nfor you. Later...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,You see, Nakajima\Nhas a thing for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,I can hear you, Yoriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:14.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's too much you don't\Nknow, Nakajima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:41.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:43.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,There seems to be\Na lot to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:48.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me for a sec. I've got to talk\Nabout something. With my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing\Nto my bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,You wiped out pretty\Nbadly this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:11:00.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,The kickstarter was broken, and\Nyou were leaking oil, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:03.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I put in new wires\Nand plugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:06.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,Give it proper maintenance\Nfrom now on, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,And I tinkered around with\Nvarious other things too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:11.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,...but this time it's a special\Njob, on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:14.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:19.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,...NOT! I mean, what's the big idea,\Nchecking up on a person like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:21.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,How much do you\Nknow about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's see, career history,\Nspecial skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and performance evaluations from your\Nprevious postings... as of now, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is that all? Then you don't know about\Nwhen I was in school, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:32.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I worked my butt off to support\Nmy motorbike hobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,...or that in school I was known\Nas the queen of tardiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and the eating monster...\NAh, I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll put that in your data file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:46.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why are you going over my background\Nlike that? What am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:49.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,My partner, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,What're you looking\Nat, Nakajima?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,The birds. I'm bird watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:08.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh? Birds are wearing uniforms\Nthese days, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... What are you talking\Nabout, Yoriko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm interested\Nin Kobaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:18.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're too easy to trip up, Nakajima.\NIt's just no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:22.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor, and don't spread\Nany weird rumors, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:23.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the tough guy, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,The tough guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we'll be in charge of the\Narea from Districts Three through Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Two patrols a day, in the morning\Nand in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,In summertime, we work 'til six.\NOh, and by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:58.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,...the basement cafeteria's "A" Lunch is\Nfull of oysters, so that'd be my pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,I don't care for oysters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:01.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,That and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,...a certain someone\Nright in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know it's rude, but\NI'm gonna be blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:11.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can make\Nthis work out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:14.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're the type that gets picky about\Ndata this and data that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:17.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,...you crack down on traffic violations\Nlike there was no tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:18.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and to top it off, you meddle\Nin other people's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're completely\Nunlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:26.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there may be no guarantees that\Nwe'll become really good partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:32.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,But there is just one thing that I can\Nsay with certainty; I'm really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:36.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,...l'm really starting to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,OK, then, let's do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:55.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll toss this coin. If it comes up\Ntails, we'll talk to the Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:59.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and have ourselves reassigned.\NIf it comes up heads...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:01.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I team up with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:16.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Our future... is in my hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:33.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's go after him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:52.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Captain! A red Mini is racing through\Nthe area! It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,A red Mini...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:57.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, Kobayakawa, and\NTsujimoto are chasing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,We've got to send out backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:00.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:05.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,There'll be no danger from that\Nred Mini. We can let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh... yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:13.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,You come along whenever\Nsomeone new shows up...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:35.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nice going! You took that corner\Nlike nobody's business!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,But it looks like you're\Nout of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's construction work up\Nahead. It's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,That was rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:50.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:56.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Nakajima?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Just putting on a little show!\NNow get after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:07.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:15.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:19.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,You were waiting for\Nus? What a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:22.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:30.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,I built that GSX-R specially... And\Nyou go and make it wipe out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll get you if it's the\Nlast thing I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fox calling Kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fox? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,The game has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's the driver\Nof that Mini!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:48.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,In 120 minutes, fireworks\Nwill go off at H8K2.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fireworks? You\Ncan't mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.28,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is he talking about\Na time bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:57.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's synchronize watches.\N3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! What the heck's H8K2?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:04.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,You will know that when all\Nthe running around is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,What're you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:09.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is a salute to the establishment\Nof your new partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,How do you know\Nabout that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:14.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Besides, we still haven't decided\Nwhether to BE partners!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is a game. Let's\Nenjoy ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you like, you can even\Ncall for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:21.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you lack confidence\Nin yourselves, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Catch me by yourselves,"\Nis that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:28.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're on! We'll catch you long\Nbefore those two hours are up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,Then I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's heading for\Nthe riverbed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:55.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:04.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it with that Mini?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's an ERA Turbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,From the outside, it's just a Mini\Nthat's been modified a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:09.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,But it's a whole different\Nbeast on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:10.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,I mean we're dealing with\Na serious car nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:13.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Then we can't beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:16.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! This car's\Nno slouch, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:17.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:20.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,I've modified the Beat-type E-074\Nengine into a twin-cam type...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and upped the displacement\Nto 700cc.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,And with the turbo and\Nintercooler systems...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:27.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,...the maximum engine output exceeds\N100 hp. And on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:28.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,"On top of that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:31.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's a custom-made\Nnitro injector, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Nitro?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.05,0:18:35.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nitro! On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're gonna catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,You tell people not to speed,\Nbut just look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:51.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,If they run, I chase them.\NIt's my job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:18:58.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:43.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Damn! Y... You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:44.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:45.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's a high school up ahead.\NThe road takes a big detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:53.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,If we play our cards right, we\Ncan catch him in a pincer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,Which means it's time for\Nthis baby's entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:01.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,This baby's smoking! She\Nreally is something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now I'm set!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:13.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,And... take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:19.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nice shot, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:24.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,Checkmate! The game\Nis over, Mr. Fox!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:34.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,This area is closed to traffic.\NMy condolences!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:39.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,You can't get away now!\NGive yourself up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:47.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,N... Natsumi! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Only thirty minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:11.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's all over, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,The game of tag ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:19.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,You both did well. As a reward,\NI'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:25.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,The code name of your goal is "Emily."\NStudy your information once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Give it everything you've got.\NThat is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Emily?" A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:34.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,What did he mean by that? I'm\Nno good at this kind of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:37.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Miyuki.\NTry to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:40.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,He said we'd understand when all\Nthe running around was done...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:43.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,When all the running\Naround was done...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:44.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Have you figured\Nsomething out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:52.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look! I've drawn a line through\Nthe roads we chased him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,Isn't this... an airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:04.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Serial number H8K2, code name "Emily,"\Nrefers to the Type Two Flying Boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:07.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,Built in 1940, it was tops in the world\Nduring WWll when it came to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:11.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,...speed, flight range, and waterborne\Ntakeoffs and landings!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:12.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's that got to do\Nwith anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.02,0:22:15.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,There still is one now...\Nat Odaiba Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.19,0:22:19.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Only twenty minutes to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:22.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,We'll never make it using normal\Nroads. Find us a short cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:23.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:30.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's a subway tunnel under\Nconstruction 500m ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:34.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,If we cut through there, it puts us directly\Non Expressway Nine... the Bayshore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:35.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:50.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.97,0:22:51.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,We gotta make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,There it is... by the landing gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.57,0:23:06.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Please evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous! Please evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:09.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,They said it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:11.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Please get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:11.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Only thirty seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.70,0:23:12.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, you get out of here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:13.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:17.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,I can defuse this old thing.\NSo get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:21.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! Even for you, it's impossible!\NI'll throw this thing in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.05,0:23:23.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's impossible, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:25.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,How many meters do you think\Nit is to the ocean from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:26.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,You can't throw it that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:53.16,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H1717C8&\pos(554.66,276.67)\frz14.48}Game over {\fnArial}♥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:27.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, let me handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:28.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Get your hands out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:30.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:32.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wow! That's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:40.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:52.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Game over. If found, please\Nreport to the police?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:53.16,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\frz17.05\pos(837.33,662)}From Fox to Kittens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:53.16,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H1717C8&\pos(554.66,276.67)\frz14.48}Game over {\fnArial}♥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:53.16,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\frz14.48\fs52\pos(631.99,412.66)\bord3\3c&HE7EBEF&}If found, please report to police.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:53.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! I just bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:23:59.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,It is! It's my lunch! I'm happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.92,0:24:04.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.55,0:24:09.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,How green.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.11,0:24:28.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,We went through a lot today... but\Ndidn't it seem pretty interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.53,0:24:30.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,...when all's said and done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:32.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't boring,\Nthat's for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:37.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hmph. You certainly looked like you\Nwere enjoying yourself, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:43.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. Thanks to my top notch\Npartner, it was an enjoyable day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.17,0:24:44.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.09,0:24:48.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Partner, are you interested\Nin moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.55,0:24:49.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Your present apartment is far away\Nand inconvenient, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.97,0:24:56.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's a nice place, very close\Nto Bokuto Precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.31,0:25:01.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Lots of sunshine, and a pretty,\Npunctual roommate, to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:04.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you by any chance suggesting\Nwe live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.61,0:25:07.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,You'd benefit by not being\Nlate anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:08.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's your real motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.99,0:25:12.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's kinda unsafe for a woman\Nto be living alone, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.57,0:25:14.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,What does that make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.58,0:25:15.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,My bodyguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.33,0:25:21.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! And I've still got\Nlunch left over, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.42,0:25:23.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, say ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.42,0:25:24.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.63,0:25:30.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Salty! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.76,0:25:37.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.57,0:25:49.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,By the way, what was the outcome\Nof that coin toss?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:52.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.36,0:25:54.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll leave it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:55.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:26:00.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,OK then, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:01.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:11.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,How about THIS?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.06,0:26:34.41,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.49,0:26:43.83,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.91,0:26:51.76,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sunset skyline flashes past{\i0}\N{\i1}in my side-view mirror.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:59.35,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the road I drive on every day,{\i0}\N{\i1}believing in my dreams.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.43,0:27:07.23,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On rainy days, windy days, and days{\i0}\N{\i1}when I wanted to throw it all away...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:15.07,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... you smiled as you{\i0}\N{\i1}sat beside me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:20.87,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the unchanging vista, the sky{\i0}\N{\i1}that we watch together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.87,0:27:31.67,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I'm confident that I can{\i0}\N{\i1}hang in there, if it's for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.75,0:27:40.14,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.26,0:27:40.39,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.73,0:27:46.77,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love this town where we{\i0}\N{\i1}happened to meet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:14.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's coming... it's coming...\NThere's a storm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:17.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,S... So you're the type that gets excited\Nwhen a typhoon comes too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.01,0:28:18.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.97,0:28:21.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, of course! Water flooding,\Nstorms thrashing...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.89,0:28:23.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,...trees falling along streets, people\Ncrashing into windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.51,0:28:25.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Streets without people!\NSlippery roads!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.93,0:28:29.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,And with things flying all over, danger\Neverywhere, it's such a joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:31.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:34.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're Under Arrest, File 2,\N"Tokyo Typhoon Rally."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.61,0:28:37.53,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,634)}TOKYO TYPHOON RALLY
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.61,0:28:37.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Looks like there're others\Njust like you!
